      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJCeh4MCcBBDQREhBn6XBo5HA/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25reU5rUk9Za1l3VW5vd00zbHpNek5DY25saFMwRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "4 個月前",
        "rating": 3,
        "text": {
          "text": "員工很友好，氣氛也還可以。說實話，食物價格有點貴，但品質還可以。其實也沒那麼糟糕，有個類似隔間的開放區域，方便你看到孩子在裡面玩耍。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "Staff was friendly, atmosphere was alright. Honestly, price of the food is quite expensive but the quality is alright. It wasn’t that bad honestly, there’s an open area-ish barrier for you to see your kids inside playing.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
