      {
        "name": "places/ChIJCeh4MCcBBDQREhBn6XBo5HA/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURoNl9LbVNnEAE",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 年前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "路過就進去吃了頓便餐。點了烤鮭魚，味道出乎意料的好。完全不像快餐，鮭魚烤得恰到好處，吃起來就像在正規餐廳吃到的一樣。下次一定還會來，嚐嚐他們家的其他菜。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "Walked by and hop in for a quick lunch. Tried their bake salmon and it's surprisingly good. It taste nothing like fast food, the salmon is properly cook and taste like a meal i have in a proper restaurant. Will definitely come again and try their other dish.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
